{
  "text": " Why do smart people make stupid trading decisions? An intelligent trader becomes more confident after the profit and losses become more emotionally. If you go to a team trade, then you say, My strategy is perfect. Confidence increases and the trader makes a reasonable position. Because there is no problem in trading, it is not because of the emotions. When money is real, it feels like it is more fair and greed to react to it. Then a big loss comes. Now, not only to understand the focus of the trader, it is just to recover the loss. And this is where the revenge trading starts. The fun part is that the trader knows the value of the value. But in that moment, he overrides the emotion logic. That is why smart traders are not the ones who are not emotional. Smart traders are the ones who follow the rules of their emotions. And if you want to understand the simple language of the trading concept, then follow.",
